OL,3,CZinedine Zidane announced as new coach
OL,4,Cof France's men's national football
OL,5,Cteam
OL,7,FZinedine Zidane has replaced Didier
OL,8,FDeschamps as the new coach of France's
OL,9,Fmen's national football team.
OL,11,FZinedane, known as Zizou, has been
OL,12,Fnamed FIFA World Player of the Year
OL,13,Fthree times.
OL,15,FThe 54-year-old has not coached since
OL,16,Fleaving Real Madrid in 2021.
