OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1785511109
OL,3,CZinedine Zidane announced as new coach
OL,4,Cof France's men's national football
OL,5,Cteam
OL,7,FFrench Football Federation (FFF)
OL,8,Fpresident Philippe Diallo announced
OL,9,FZidane's appointment on Tuesday in
OL,10,FParis, granting him a 4-year contract
OL,11,Fwith the team.
OL,13,FZidane expressed his "immense joy" and
OL,14,Fexcitement to be offered the job, and
OL,15,Fsaid it was the happiest day of his
OL,16,Fcareer as coach.
OL,18,F"The France team makes you dream," he
OL,19,Fsaid, "We have extraordinary players,
OL,20,Fan extraordinary team.
