OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1785511109
OL,3,CZinedine Zidane announced as new coach
OL,4,Cof France's men's national football
OL,5,Cteam
OL,7,F"I've waited five years for this
OL,8,Fchance, so that's why I'm a bit
OL,9,Femotional," he added.
OL,11,FDeschamps left France after his team
OL,12,Flost 2-0 to Spain in the World Cup
OL,13,Fsemi-finals.
OL,15,FThe FFF president described Zidane as
OL,16,F"one of the legends of French soccer".
