OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1785511109
OL,3,CZinedine Zidane announced as new coach
OL,4,Cof France's men's national football
OL,5,Cteam
OL,7,FThe former French player previously
OL,8,Fcoached Real Madrid between 2019 and
OL,9,F2021, leading them to win multiple
OL,10,Ftrophies, including three straight
OL,11,FChampions League titles.
OL,13,FZidane said he was offered to coach
OL,14,Fother clubs but turned them down for
OL,15,FFrance.
OL,17,FWith a breaking voice, he said: "I've
OL,18,Falways watched this side as a fan and
OL,19,Falso as a future coach, I won't hide
OL,20,Fit.
OL,26,@yD@aOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/7
