CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1785511109
OL,3,CZinedine Zidane announced as new coach
OL,4,Cof France's men's national football
OL,5,Cteam
OL,7,F"That's why I didn't take a club side.
OL,8,FI told myself that the only thing I
OL,9,Fwanted to do after Madrid was taking
OL,10,Fthe France team."
OL,12,F"Today I have the opportunity to be in
OL,13,Fcharge of this team and I will give
OL,14,Feverything so that this team can win,"
OL,15,Fhe added, and congratulated Deschamps
OL,16,Fon his career.
OL,18,FZidane will coach his first France
OL,19,Fgame in Turkey for the Nations League
OL,20,Fon September 25, followed by a match
OL,21,Fin Belgium three days later.
