OL,3,CZinedine Zidane announced as new coach
OL,4,Cof France's men's national football
OL,5,Cteam
OL,7,FHe will only be spotted at Stade de
OL,8,FFrance when the team play Italy on
OL,9,FOctober 2.
OL,11,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,12,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,13,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,14,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,16,FThe match comes 20 years after the
OL,17,F2006 World Cup final against Italy
OL,18,Fwhen Zidane was sent off for
OL,19,Fheadbutting Italy defender Marco
OL,20,FMaterazzi in the chest.
