OL,3,CZinedine Zidane announced as new coach
OL,4,Cof France's men's national football
OL,5,Cteam
OL,7,FZidane said he has made a mental note
OL,8,Fof the future matches, saying: "Italy
OL,9,Fis special, because I played there,
OL,10,Fbecause I know people, because I speak
OL,11,FItalian. All of those things.
OL,13,F"I was a leader on the field and now I
OL,14,Fwant to be a leader by experience."
